<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39896" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικροτ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rattle on</i> or <i>over</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ δ᾽ ἐπικροτέοντα πέτοντο ἅρματα</span> flew
				<i>rattling over</i> the ground, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				308
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c. acc.,
				<i>strike with</i>
			<i>a rattling sound, clash</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύμβαλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alciphr.
					1.12
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κρόταλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Syr.D.</u>
					44
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένειον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>C.</u>
					2.244
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>clap,
				applaud</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				887
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cont.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>. c.dat.instr.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ὀδοῦσι</span>
			<i>chatter</i> with one's teeth, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philopatr.</u>
				21
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τοῖς δακτύλοις</span>
			<i>snap</i> the fingers, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1602.16
			</span></i>: abs., <i><span class="en">
				Aristobul.
				9J.
			</span></i>codd.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
